nodes.body:
Validated end to end in node:sqlite 3.53.4 (2,000 nodes + 4,000 tags in 89 ms, tag search, camelCase search and UPDATE all correct; 5,000 nodes + 20,000 edges = 7.22 MB):
```sql
CREATE TABLE node(id TEXT PRIMARY KEY, kind TEXT NOT NULL, title TEXT NOT NULL, body TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '',
  status TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'live', confidence REAL NOT NULL DEFAULT 0.5,
  superseded_by TEXT REFERENCES node(id), topic TEXT, created_at TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT (datetime('now')));
CREATE INDEX node_live ON node(kind,status) WHERE status='live';
CREATE TABLE edge(id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY, src TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES node(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
  rel TEXT NOT NULL, dst TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES node(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
  attrs TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '{}', status TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'live', UNIQUE(src,rel,dst));
CREATE INDEX edge_src ON edge(src,rel); CREATE INDEX edge_dst ON edge(dst,rel);
CREATE TABLE evidence(id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY, node_id TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES node(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
  url TEXT NOT NULL, quote TEXT, method TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'read', observed_at TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT (datetime('now')));
CREATE TABLE tag(node_id TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES node(id) ON DELETE CASCADE, tag TEXT NOT NULL, PRIMARY KEY(node_id,tag)) WITHOUT ROWID;
CREATE TABLE fts_src(id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY, key TEXT UNIQUE NOT NULL, title TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '',
  body TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '', tags TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '', grams TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '');
CREATE VIRTUAL TABLE node_fts USING fts5(title,body,tags,grams,content='fts_src',
  content_rowid='id', tokenize='porter unicode61');
```
Five sync triggers maintain fts_src → node_fts, each ordered delete-with-old-values → update shadow → insert-new-values. Keep `node` as sole authority and make FTS fully rebuildable (`INSERT INTO node_fts(node_fts) VALUES('rebuild')`), so a corrupt or stale index is a repair, not data loss.
